<title>POLAND: POLISH BANKS BID FOR PLN 385 MLN OF NBP-BILLS.</title>
<headline>POLISH BANKS BID FOR PLN 385 MLN OF NBP-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish Banks bid for 385 million zlotys of 273-day NBP-bills at the National Bank of Poland's 400 million zloty auction, the central bank said.</p>
<p>Full details of the auction should be available at about 1300 local time.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
